    "text": "<p>As per the given circuit, the value of current through the battery will be _____ A.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9518db1d-9c7e-494a-ab9a-77517b6ea6ee-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></p>",
