  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9518db1d-9c7e-494a-ab9a-77517b6ea6ee-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>In the given circuit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be reverse biased and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;forward biased. Therefore,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cdc8d630-c06d-4e87-aa0c-5dbc2f3682b5-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 126px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
